PROJECT BlogAPI

TARGET PHP

PROFILE BLOG

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL User
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE
    password STRING
    bio TEXT OPTIONAL

MODEL Post
    title STRING
    content TEXT
    published BOOLEAN OPTIONAL

MODEL Comment
    body TEXT

RELATION User HAS_MANY Post
RELATION User HAS_MANY Comment
RELATION Post HAS_MANY Comment

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8
VALIDATE Post.title REQUIRED MAX 120
VALIDATE Comment.body REQUIRED MAX 2000

ROUTE POST /login
ROUTE GET /posts
ROUTE GET /posts/{id}
ROUTE POST /posts
ROUTE PATCH /posts/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /posts/{id}
ROUTE GET /posts/{id}/comments
ROUTE POST /comments
ROUTE DELETE /comments/{id}
ROUTE GET /users/{id}/posts
